## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 can of chicken or 1 [cooked chicken breast]{ ing="cooked-chicken-breast" }, diced
- [ ] 1/4 cup [chopped celery]{ ing="chopped-celery" } or cucumber
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [mayo]{ ing="mayo" }
- [ ] [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }
- [ ] [Optionally add parsley]{ ing="optionally-add-parsley" }

## Recipe

1. Combine and serve on sandwiches
